@startuml

actor "用户" as User
participant "Frontend" as Frontend
participant "Backend Controller" as BackendController
participant "Backend Service" as BackendService
participant "Database" as Database

User -> Frontend: 触发保存操作
Frontend -> BackendController: 发起更新用户信息请求
BackendController -> BackendService: 调用updateById方法
BackendService -> Database: 更新用户信息
Database --> BackendService: 返回更新结果
BackendService --> BackendController: 返回更新结果
BackendController --> Frontend: 返回更新结果

@enduml
